{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115908","id":3901615540,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7oje20","number":115908,"title":"Default values are not applied at node creation when implementing _property_can_revert and _property_get_revert","user":{"login":"jmorel-jfc-albi","id":253939132,"node_id":"U_kgDODyLNvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253939132?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi","html_url":"https://github.com/jmorel-jfc-albi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmorel-jfc-albi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-02-05T13:33:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T09:57:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested and reproducible consistently in 4.6.\nPossibly just forgot to be implemented in the first place.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows11 and Linux Mint, but probably hapens on all OS\n\n### Issue description\n\nCreating a node that is attached to a tool scripts that implements _property_can_revert and _property_get_revert doesn't apply the values by default.\n\nexample :\n```gdscript\n@tool\nclass_name Hitbox3D extends Area3D\n\n\nfunc _property_can_revert(property: StringName) -> bool:\n\treturn property in [&\"monitorable\", &\"collision_layer\"]\n\n\nfunc _property_get_revert(property: StringName) -> Variant:\n\tmatch property:\n\t\t&\"monitorable\": return false\n\t\t&\"collision_layer\": return 0\n\treturn null\n\n# some more logic ...\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- create a tool script implementing `_property_can_revert` and `_property_get_revert`\n- Restart Godot to ensure tool script function properly\n- Create or Open a Scene\n- Add the node that have the same name as your class_name in the NodeTree\n- Notice that the editor shows revertible changes in the inspector, but haven't applied them as default\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nCreate a new project with the above script named how you want (ex: hitbox3d.gd) and placed anywhere in the project.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115908/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}